TECHNIQUE FILE - THE SIX PATHS OF PAIN (NAGATO)
Dojutsu: the Rinnegan. The Leader fights through six bodies, not one.

Nagato, hidden and crippled, controls six reanimated corpses through chakra receivers,
each corpse a "Path" sharing his Rinnegan and a distinct function. All six see through
shared vision.

- Deva Path: gravity manipulation. Shinra Tensei repels all; Bansho Ten'in draws in.
  Chibaku Tensei forms a gravitational sphere prison. The lead body.
- Asura Path: mechanised body with hidden weaponry, blades, and missiles.
- Human Path: reads and rips the soul from a target, extracting knowledge, killing them.
- Animal Path: summons a menagerie of beasts without hand seals.
- Preta Path: absorbs chakra and nullifies ninjutsu on contact.
- Naraka Path: summons the King of Hell to judge, restrain, and fully restore the
  other Paths' bodies.

Together they wield all six chakra natures and every Rinnegan power. Nagato's true
body is the target; the Paths are only his hands.
